    <string name="about_data">Films and series: Cinemeta, the library of Stremio. Names in your language and Spotlight lists: TMDB. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB. History: Trakt. Channel logos: iptv-org. App logos: Simple Icons. Weather: Open-Meteo. Screensaver paintings: public domain, through Wikimedia Commons.</string>
